 "duration": 20.89,
 "lines": "absent artificial escapes / & machine learned / strengths / from our highs / & lows / as sourced materials— ... (A life flashes the way a reel does: the window, the tambourine, the field, the stars, the candle, the daisy, the ride, the temple, the hourglass.)",
 "read": "absent artificial escapes and machine learning strengths for my highs and lows as resource materials. Well, I can't leave behind the impulse that comes from battle scars and can't leave behind the wisdom that brushes gray tones into our melanin after disappointments and defeats.",
